{"title":"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The larger of two consecutive odd integers is three times the smaller. What is their sum?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/05167631e049f1bae6e04bac325b3ee0289962ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 16 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the two consecutive odd integers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/faef3f20663194a7f042daba32ca9fb69cd01f1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eacebe080b30c45dab908f749cc1748cc675898a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+2 = 3a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/3/6e3c4cedb669720ba20dc97034bf54818677aab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1, a + 2 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" /> and their sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbdd2367a36cd68b993f813c660164888676a9e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\ \\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"56\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A\">2007 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.